Ek variable userAge banayein. Agar age 18 ya us se zyada ho to "You are eligible" show karein, warna "You are not eligible".

Ek variable userName banayein. Agar name "Ali" ho to "Welcome Ali" show karein, warna "Unknown User".

Ek variable marks banayein. Agar marks 50 ya us se zyada hon to "Pass" show karein, warna "Fail".

Ek variable temperature banayein. Agar temperature 30 se zyada ho to "Hot Weather" show karein, warna "Normal Weather".

Ek variable number banayein. Check karein ke number 100 ke equal hai ya nahi.